{
	"name": "Rooted in Earth",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/nature/root-vine-entangle-foot-green.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 6th level, you gain resistance to poison damage.</p><p>Additionally, as a bonus action, grounding roots shoot out of your lower limbs to help you keep your feet. While these roots are active, your movement Speed is halved, but you have advantage on saving throws made to resist being shoved or knocked prone, and you are immune to being knocked prone by difficult terrain. These roots last a number of rounds equal to your Constitution modifier or until you dismiss them as a bonus action. Once you have used this ability, you may not do so again until you complete a short or a long rest.</p>",
